[27.322082, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me first\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexamine\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gcurrent\u001b[23Gcode\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gtests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow let me run\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gtests\u001b[28Gto\u001b[31Gsee\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gcurrent\u001b[47Gfailures:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPerfect! I can see the\u001b[26Gissue.\u001b[33GThe\u001b[37Gfunction\u001b[46Gcurrently\u001b[56Guses\u001b[61Gfloor\u001b[67Gdivision\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m),\u001b[9Gwhich\u001b[15Gtruncates\u001b[25Ginstead\u001b[33Gof\u001b[36Grounding\u001b[45Ghalf\u001b[50Gup.\u001b[54GI'll\u001b[59Gfix\u001b[63Git\u001b[66Gto\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gimpl\u001b[8Gment proper round-half-up logic:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=19rw1ia;file:///root/b/billing/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
